# Unpromoted evidence runs. Promotion is an atomic rename that happens only once a pack
# is complete and hashed; a `.partial` directory is a run that never got there. Committing
# one publishes an unfinished run as a result. The boundary is also asserted in
# tests/evidence-hygiene.test.mjs, because an ignore rule is a default and not a control.
*.partial/
